7-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"MSTC Limited reported its highest-ever Q2 and H1 performance since listing, driven by higher scrap rates, increased iron ore volumes, and higher e-sale numbers. Management highlighted positive profitability from its joint venture MMRPL and noted that the company has received in-principle approval from the RBI for its TReDS platform. The company is also evaluating the setting up of coal and mineral exchanges in light of recent ministerial notifications. Management maintains a conservative outlook aiming for double-digit growth while navigating regulatory approvals for initiatives like the EPR exchange. MSTC Limited reported its operational and financial performance for the quarter and half year ended September 30, 2026, registering its highest ever Q2 and H1 PBT and PAT since listing in March 2019.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management stated that double-digit growth aspiration has been between 10% to 20% over the past 3 years.","quote":"So between 10% to 20%. So that is something that we would always aspire to...","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated an aim to maintain a double-digit growth average over a longer period.","quote":"So, our aim is to maintain a double-digit number.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Scrap rates have hardened over the past two quarters.","quote":"So it has hardened for the past couple of quarters. Let us see how it goes.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"MSTC is developing a TReDS platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","quote":"MSTC is developing a TReDS platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=83d3e06e-a4ec-43c2-ae07-d343d1662595.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Total expenses for the standalone business stood at INR79.14 crores compared to INR70.17 crores.","quote":"And the total overhead, total expenses stands at INR79.14 crores as compared to INR70.17 crores as an increase of only 12.78%, whereas revenue has grown by 31.25%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf"},{"claim":"Employee benefits for the standalone business were INR51.89 crores compared to INR46.34 crores.","quote":"and employee benefits as a normal expense of around 12% comes to INR51.89 crores as compared to INR46.34 crore.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf"},{"claim":"Management reported that the EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, which is nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","quote":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, also nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"During the quarter, liquor license auctions were held for the Government of Karnataka, resulting in revenue of approximately INR125 crores for the state.","quote":"So during the quarter, liquor license auctions were held for the Government of Karnataka, resulting in revenue of approximately INR125 crores for the state.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf"},{"claim":"INR2,863 crores was realized for the State of Telangana through a successful land parcel auction.","quote":"INR2,863 crores was realized for the State of Telangana through successful land parcel auction.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf"},{"claim":"An oil rig was auctioned on behalf of MSTC realizing $5.8 million.","quote":"An oil rig was auctioned on behalf of MSTC realizing $5.8 million.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"MSTC has finally exited the trading business.","quote":"total gross merchandise value that has passed through our portal is INR545.80 billion, and basically it is excluding the trading business this we have, MSTC has finally exited as promised earlier also that it will go to the very risk-free zone.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the company took a decision to remain an asset-light company.","quote":"We also took a decision to remain an asset-light company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management expects the TReDS platform to stabilize and become a healthy addition to revenue streams over the next 2 fiscals.","quote":"and we are hopeful that this will be a healthy addition to our revenue stream when the platform stabilizes, which should happen over the next 2 fiscals.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 fiscals"},{"claim":"Management expects to come to a firm conclusion regarding the coal exchange evaluation in 3 to 4 months.","quote":"We intend to -- we expect that we will come to some kind of a firm conclusion in, let us say, 3 to 4 months, and then we will be able to share as to what is the way forward that we have visualized.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=6b17bd6c-7b55-4996-8fc6-328900f8c1a3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"MSTC has completed the planned process of exiting the legacy Trading business.","quote":"MSTC has now completed the planned process of exiting the legacy Trading business.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=83d3e06e-a4ec-43c2-ae07-d343d1662595.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"Management stated the internal target is to hopefully operationalize the TReDS platform within FY27, subject to regulatory approvals.","quote":"So, our internal target is hopefully FY27, within FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":16,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":5,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}